--- Interpretation Guide for Figure 18 ---
  • Manually Corrected: Records fixed by human review (no longer need attention)
  • Auto-Detected: Algorithm-flagged records requiring human review
  • Temporal Issues: Chronological order errors (e.g., sleep before bed)
  • Metrics Issues: Abnormal SOL, SE, or TST/TIB ratio
  • Amount/Input Flags: Substance amount input anomalies
  • Interval Format: Duration values with formatting issues
  • Timestamp Format: Time values with formatting issues

